Actually, I know what the problem might be - the WebSocket frame I'm sending is missing the MASK bit. In the WebSocket protocol, **client-to-server frames MUST be masked**. My frames have opcode 0x81 which is FIN + text (opcode 1), but I'm not setting the MASK bit (0x80 on the second byte).

